# Read by lamp-update itself, never by systemd: a round carries this file among the build's settings, so a lamp
# already in a home turns the models switch on without its own unit changing (docs/updates.md, "Models in the
# manifest"; same-voice step 2). LAMP_UPDATE_MODELS set in lamp-update.service's environment wins over it, so
# LAMP_UPDATE_MODELS=off there holds the models off. Anything but this line on is off.
LAMP_UPDATE_MODELS=on
